{"q":"/types/344732?lang=it","data":{"id":344732,"url":"https://it.numista.com/344732","title":"2 Euros (The Legend of Charlemagne)","object_type":{"id":3,"name":"Moneta non in circolazione"},"issuer":{"code":"andorre","name":"Andorra"},"min_year":2022,"max_year":2022,"ruler":[{"id":4700,"name":"Joan Enric Vives i Sicília","wikidata_id":"Q57473","group":{"id":377,"name":"Coprincipato"}}],"value":{"text":"2 Euro","numeric_value":2,"currency":{"id":9024,"name":"Euro","full_name":"Euro (2014-oggi)"}},"issue_terms":{"is_issued":true,"issue_date":"2023-01-16"},"demonetization":{"is_demonetized":false},"size":25.75,"thickness":2.2,"shape":"Rotonda","composition":{"text":"Bimetallico: centro in nickel\n rivestito di ottone al nichel con anello in rame-nichel (Core: 75% Cu, 20% Zn, 5% Ni Ring: 75% Cu, 25% Ni)"},"technique":{"text":"Fresato"},"obverse":{"description":"Sullo sfondo, un paesaggio con montagne e un fiume, che rappresenta il ricco scenario di Andorra. In primo piano, una riproduzione parziale del noto ritratto dell'imperatore Carlo Magno, opera dell'artista Albrecht Dürer. L'anello esterno della moneta raffigura le 12 stelle della bandiera europea.","lettering":"ANDORRA\r\n2022","lettering_scripts":[{"name":"Latino"}],"picture":"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/photos/andorre/63dffaa91e8c21.81800028-original.jpg","thumbnail":"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/photos/andorre/63dffaa91e8c21.81800028-180.jpg","picture_copyright":"albinh","picture_license_name":"CC BY-NC-SA","picture_license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/deed.it"},"reverse":{"designers":["Luc Luycx"],"description":"Una mappa, accanto al valore nominale, mostra il continente europeo senza confini.","lettering":"2 EURO\r\nLL","lettering_scripts":[{"name":"Latino"}],"picture":"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/photos/andorre/635c2d5ba223b9.09972680-original.jpg","thumbnail":"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/photos/andorre/635c2d5ba223b9.09972680-180.jpg","picture_copyright":"albinh","picture_license_name":"CC BY-NC-SA","picture_license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/deed.it"},"commemorated_topic":"La leggenda di Carlo Magno","comments":"(en) <p>Legend has it that Emperor Charlemagne was the founder of Andorra in the year 805 and that he granted its inhabitants their own legal status. The design of the coin represents this legend deeply rooted in the history and culture of Andorra.</p>","related_types":[{"id":356441,"title":"2 Euros (Charlemagne)","category":"coin","country":{"code":"allemagne","name":"Germany, Federal Republic of"},"minYear":2023,"maxYear":2023}],"tags":["Monarca","Figure religiose","Montagna","Fiume","Carta geografica","Baffi","Corona","Armi bianche"],"references":[{"catalogue":{"id":3,"code":"KM"},"number":"570"}],"weight":8.5,"orientation":"medal","edge":{"description":"Scrittura incisa su rossetto: \"2\" seguito da due stelle a cinque punte, ripetute sei volte alternativamente dal basso verso l'alto e viceversa.","lettering":"2 ★ ★ ↊ ★ ★ 2 ★ ★ ↊ ★ ★ 2 ★ ★ ↊ ★ ★","lettering_scripts":[{"name":"Latino"}],"picture":"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/photos/andorre/695e1064dfbf22.55047269-original.jpg","thumbnail":"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/photos/andorre/695e1064dfbf22.55047269-180.jpg","picture_copyright":"albinh","picture_license_name":"CC BY-NC-SA","picture_license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/deed.it"},"mints":[{"id":24,"name":"Royal Mint of Madrid"}],"category":"coin","type":"Moneta non in circolazione"}}